 "about": "Apex v2.9 paper (rules v2.9-paper-1): the Robinhood scanner pull that covers the whole eligible universe. The scanner returns at most 200 rows a query, so the universe is pulled in 12 sector / market-cap slices; every slice must return rows == total_items. If a slice ever reports more than 200, split it at a market cap between its bounds and pull both halves. Read-only previews: nothing is saved in Robinhood.",
